  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Every time I close the game and reopen in VR, FBT is always enabled though I DON'T HAVE FBT AT ALL. I have to keep tuning it off in the game settings, every time I relog back in or if there's an update it turns back on.\n\nI've had this issue for many years and when I keep making a post about it, it's ignored.\n\nI have already uninstalled, re-installed, validated files, deleted the game folder and reinstalled it and it keeps happening.",
